{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approaches, take it and process it. Then move or scan to find another. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
